{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-08_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-08","title":"黄昏","storyCode":"3-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"1252098d1296a6d7ef45f4ec66ee02b9bc5ea1194d3b66c0d6fc1c302b93756c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“碎骨”再次倒下，但没有人露出笑容。陈没有安慰阿米娅，只是难得吐露了一些心声。\n带着各种各样的思绪，众人踏上归途。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已经结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_coma"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人总是会超出预期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者更会如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"力量使人疯狂，欲望使人堕落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像癌症一样，一点点侵蚀着所有美好的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对你来说，这面具什么意义都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想留着，就留着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"总有一天，这种面具会堆满你的房间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都要为他们的选择承担后果。感染者与否，都没有区别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈警官......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"听着，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动，这些人，如果他们愿意倾听你的话语，你可以尽你所能帮助他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果他们拒绝听取任何声音，只想把余下的所有生命献给疯狂......不要再犹豫了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她也并没有作恶。并且，这也不是什么罪恶的下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"仅仅是因为她选择了这个结果而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没人有资格去阻止她，没有人有资格去责怪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......一直以来，我都觉得我们有一种责任，去帮助应该帮助的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，为什么......最后会变成这样。为什么她需要去一个人承担这样的后果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛所做的事情，真的是正确的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"从感染了矿石病开始，人的命运就不再是由他一个人掌握的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也许在罗德岛看来，误入歧途还是可以被拯救的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但是对我而言，对近卫局而言，却并非如此。可能，在必要的时候，必须......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想去改变那种永无止境的状况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是一点点，一点点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......这一切如果最后只能变成这样的结局，那我只能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你动摇了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者不是被敌意溺死，就是自己走向毁灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"悲剧只会一次接一次的重演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"在这苦恨的循环里，除了消灭矿石病之外，还有一种方法可以让感染者重拾希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就是，熄灭这根荆棘锁链上的仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"给予仁慈是需要付出足够的代价的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛永远也不会变成近卫局这样，也做不到近卫局那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你们罗德岛愿意接纳多少感染者，妄想通过柔软的手法拯救多少人————那都是罗德岛才能做，或者说————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛才会做的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这样的事情，我不能做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局————更加不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少，除了他的同胞以外，还有你会去留下他的面具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果这样的面具，注定会堆满你的房间，那就让他堆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"记住，这是你的事，不是别人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——罗德岛的小小的“领导人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你已经真的做好了心理准备去背负这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"做出你的选择，承担你选择的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局在清扫现场之后会进行休整，之后，我会联系那个医生的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，看来人的命运总是交织在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"互相牵绊，互相阻挠。再好的棋手都会被一些意外将了军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，也不差。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至少，之后的事情......还算值得期待，呵呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
